81 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 201 0 R
/E (The Verdict: "Overall, the application functions as intended, but several areas require immediate attention. The assessment identified 1 High-Risk, 3 Medium-Risk, and 1 Low-Risk vulnerabilities. The most critical issue is the exposure of outdated administrative services \(SSH\) to the public internet, which could allow unauthorized access. Other findings relate to missing modern web security configurations.")
/Pg 11 0 R
